{"sections":[],"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit uses a layered event dispatch system. When a key is pressed, it passes through up to five layers. The first layer that consumes the event wins: remaining layers are skipped. Layer 0 (text input) and Layer 3 (focus system) are mutually exclusive: when a text input element is focused, Layer 0 runs and Layer 3 is skipped."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"keyboard-event-dispatch.png","type":"image"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Additionally, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Ctrl+C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (SIGINT) is handled at the OS signal level ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"text":" any of these layers: it always terminates the application.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Available Keys","anchor":"Available-Keys"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines all keys that TUIkit can recognize from terminal input:"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Character Keys","anchor":"Character-Keys"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any printable character is represented as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".character(Character)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":[".onKeyPress(Key.from(\"x\")) {","    \/\/ handle \"x\" key","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uppercase detection: when a capital letter is typed, the resulting "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" has "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shift: true"},{"type":"text","text":" set automatically."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Special Keys","anchor":"Special-Keys"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".escape","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Escape key","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".enter","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enter \/ Return","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".tab","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".backspace","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Backspace \/ Delete backward","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".delete"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Forward delete","type":"text"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Arrow-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Arrow Keys","level":3},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".up"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow up","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".down"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow down","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".left","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow left","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".right","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow right"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Navigation-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Navigation Keys","level":3},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".home"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Home"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"End"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".pageUp","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".pageDown","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Down"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Key-Events-and-Modifiers","type":"heading","text":"Key Events and Modifiers","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" combines a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with modifier flags:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["public struct KeyEvent {","    public let key: Key","    public let ctrl: Bool     \/\/ Ctrl modifier","    public let alt: Bool      \/\/ Alt \/ Option modifier","    public let shift: Bool    \/\/ Shift modifier","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The terminal encodes modifiers differently from GUI frameworks:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ctrl+letter","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Detected from ASCII control codes (0x01–0x1A). For example, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"text":" produces byte ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0x03"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Alt+key","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Detected from ESC prefix sequences ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ESC"},{"type":"text","text":" followed by the key byte)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Only auto-detected for uppercase letters. The terminal does not send distinct shift codes for most keys."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Registering Key Handlers","anchor":"Registering-Key-Handlers"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onKeyPress()"},{"text":" modifier to handle keyboard events in your views:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handle All Keys","anchor":"Handle-All-Keys"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Press any key\")","    .onKeyPress { event in","        if event.key == .enter {","            doSomething()","            return true   \/\/ consumed: stops propagation","        }","        return false      \/\/ not consumed: passes to next handler","    }"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handle Specific Keys","anchor":"Handle-Specific-Keys"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Use arrow keys\")","    .onKeyPress(keys: [.up, .down]) { event in","        if event.key == .up { moveUp() }","        else { moveDown() }","        return true","    }"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handle a Single Key","anchor":"Handle-a-Single-Key"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The single-key variant always consumes the event:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Press Enter to continue\")","    .onKeyPress(.enter) {","        continueAction()","    }"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handler Priority","anchor":"Handler-Priority"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Handlers are dispatched in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"reverse registration order","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the deepest view in the tree (most recently registered) gets the event first. This means inner views can intercept events before outer views see them.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["VStack {","    Text(\"Outer\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Only reached if inner handler did NOT consume it","            print(\"outer enter\")","        }","    Text(\"Inner\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Gets the event FIRST","            print(\"inner enter\")","        }","}"]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All key handlers are re-registered every render frame. If a view is not rendered (e.g. behind a conditional), its handlers are not active.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Focus Navigation","anchor":"Focus-Navigation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"},{"text":" dispatches key events in three steps:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Focused element delegation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the focused element’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)"},{"text":" is called first. If it consumes the event, dispatch stops.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab \/ Shift+Tab"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": cycles focus between elements (wraps around).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow key fallback","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Up\/Left move to the previous element in the section, Down\/Right move to the next. This only triggers if the focused element did not consume the arrow key in step 1.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the next focusable element (wraps around)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift+Tab","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the previous focusable element (wraps around)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Up \/ Left","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move to previous element in section (fallback)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Down \/ Right","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move to next element in section (fallback)","type":"text"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For more details, see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Default Bindings","anchor":"Default-Bindings"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Layer 4 provides three built-in key bindings that work without any configuration:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Condition","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"Q","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Quit application","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Only when ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","type":"reference"},{"text":" allows it","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"t"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cycle to next color theme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only when theme cycling is enabled"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"a","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"A","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next appearance"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Always active","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Quit Behavior","anchor":"Quit-Behavior"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","type":"reference"},{"text":" enum controls when ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is allowed to quit:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Value","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Behavior","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".always","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" quits from any screen (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rootOnly"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only quits when no status bar context is pushed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".rootOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is useful for modal dialogs: push a status bar context for the dialog, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will be blocked until the user dismisses it:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Dialog(title: \"Confirm\") {","    Text(\"Are you sure?\")","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Yes\") { confirm() }","        Button(\"No\") { cancel() }","    }","}",".statusBarItems(context: \"confirm-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\")","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Changing the built-in quit key","anchor":"Changing-the-built-in-quit-key"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default quit binding is configurable through "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarState\/quitShortcut","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@Environment(\\.statusBar) private var statusBar","","statusBar.quitShortcut = .escape","statusBar.quitShortcut = .ctrlQ","statusBar.quitShortcut = QuitShortcut(","    key: .f12,","    shortcutSymbol: Shortcut.f12,","    label: \"exit\"",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This changes both the Layer 4 quit binding and the displayed system item."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Overriding `q` in a local view context","anchor":"Overriding-q-in-a-local-view-context"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A user-defined status bar item with shortcut "},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and an action intercepts the key before the default quit binding runs:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["EditorView()","    .statusBarItems {","        StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"close\") {","            dismissEditor()","        }","    }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the correct way to repurpose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" for a specific screen, dialog, or focus section. The matching user item handles the event in Layer 1, so Layer 4’s built-in quit binding is never reached."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Status Bar Shortcuts","anchor":"Status-Bar-Shortcuts"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status bar displays available shortcuts to the user. Use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" namespace for consistent, platform-standard symbols:"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Display Symbols","anchor":"Display-Symbols"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":[".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.escape, label: \"back\")","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Common Symbols","anchor":"Common-Symbols"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineCont